---
source: tests/cli_manifest.rs
expression: tree
---
organization (1)
└── default_organization  Demo Organization
data_use (1)
└── third_party_sharing.personalized_advertising.direct_marketing  Direct Marketing
    └── parent: third_party_sharing.personalized_advertising
data_subject (1)
└── potential_customer  Potential Customer
dataset (1)
└── demo_users_dataset  Demo Users Dataset
    └── users
        ├── created_at  system.operations
        ├── email  user.contact.email
        ├── first_name  user.name
        ├── food_preference  (uncategorized)
        ├── state  user.contact.state
        └── uuid  user.unique_id
system (2)
├── demo_analytics_system  Demo Analytics System
│   ├── type: Service
│   ├── ← ingress demo_users_dataset
│   └── Analyze customer behaviour for improvements.
│       ├── use: improve.system
│       ├── categories: user.contact, user.device.cookie_id
│       ├── subjects: customer
│       └── ingress: demo_users_dataset
└── demo_marketing_system  Demo Marketing System
    ├── type: Service
    └── Collect data for marketing
        ├── use: advertising
        ├── categories: user.cookie_id
        └── subjects: customer
policy (1)
└── demo_privacy_policy  Demo Privacy Policy
    └── Reject Direct Marketing
        ├── data_categories ANY user.contact
        ├── data_uses ANY advertising
        └── data_subjects ANY customer
